---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy | JiApps Organization"
  description="JiApps Cookie Policy: Learn how our website uses cookies and lightweight local storage to deliver secure, functional web services."
>
  <main id="main" class="flex-grow">
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-14 md:pt-20 pb-16">
      <div class="sticker mb-6 rotate-0">Cookie Governance</div>
      <h1 class="h-page mb-6">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-ink-light text-base mb-8">
        Last updated: October 2026 &bull; Effective for JiApps Organization (jiapp.online) and affiliated portals.
      </p>

      <div class="card p-8 md:p-12 space-y-8 bg-white text-ink leading-relaxed text-base">
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-600">1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
          <p>
            Cookies are small text files placed on your computer, mobile device, or tablet by websites you visit. They are widely used to make websites work properly, enhance user experience, and provide essential session and technical information to website owners.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-600">2. Our Minimalist Cookie Philosophy</h2>
          <p>
            At JiApps, we believe in privacy-by-design. We do not use intrusive tracking cookies, aggressive behavioral ad profilers, or sell your navigation history to data brokers. Our use of cookies is strictly limited to essential functionality, session performance, and security.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-600">3. Categories of Cookies We Use</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-brand-50/70 border-2 border-line">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">A. Strictly Necessary &amp; Functional Storage</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-ink-light mt-1">
                These cookies and browser storage keys are required for the website to function correctly. They store preferences such as your chosen theme (dark/light mode), interface responsiveness states, and form submission security tokens.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-brand-50/70 border-2 border-line">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">B. Customer Support &amp; Live Chat (Tawk.to)</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-ink-light mt-1">
                To offer direct real-time assistance through our integrated live chat widget, our customer support partner (Tawk.to) stores lightweight cookies to remember your conversation thread, agent responses, and active session status across page navigations.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-brand-50/70 border-2 border-line">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-ink">C. Anonymized Technical Telemetry</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-ink-light mt-1">
                We may measure aggregated technical performance (such as page load speeds and device screen categories) to optimize loading performance for users with varying network bandwidths. No personal identities are linked to these metrics.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-600">4. Managing &amp; Disabling Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            Most modern web browsers allow you to manage your cookie preferences through their settings:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-ink-light">
            <li>You can set your browser to alert you when cookies are being placed.</li>
            <li>You can refuse all or certain browser cookies, or delete existing cookies at any time.</li>
            <li>Please note that disabling strictly necessary functional cookies may affect certain interactive elements of the website.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-600">5. Updates to This Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may periodically update this Cookie Policy to reflect changes in technical standards, statutory regulations, or service features. Any modifications will be posted here with an updated effective date.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-600">6. Questions &amp; Contact</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions or feedback regarding our cookie governance or data privacy practices, please contact us at:
          </p>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 border-2 border-line">
            <p class="font-bold text-ink">JiApps Organization &bull; Technical Compliance</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-light mt-1">Email: <a href="mailto:hello@jiapp.online" class="font-mono font-bold text-brand-600 underline">hello@jiapp.online</a></p>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-light">Website: <a href="https://jiapp.online" class="underline">https://jiapp.online</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
